id: pm-rl-sdk-1122
title: Adopt pm-cli 2026.11.24 host-aligned SDK behaviour
description: "Companion: pm-cli-website-spus. Acceptance: pin the current first-party toolchain, align mutation guards and command fixtures with native dispatch, preserve published dependency notes, and record the scoped local gates and CI evidence."
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[1]: "gh:unbraind/pm-rl#191"
created_at: "2026-11-24T15:34:45.963Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-24T16:00:17.416Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[4]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-24T15:35:01.111Z",codex-agent,"Toolchain PR #191 fails in build:test before TAP because the guard fixture lacks actor and dry_run. Actions PR #198 fails changelog:check before tests from dependency-note drift. Plan: adopt the installed host contract, preserve the historical writer fixture, and verify the package changes with scoped gates."
  "2026-11-24T15:40:42.645Z",codex-agent,"The new host emits missing_required_option with the declared flag and still refuses before dispatch. Updated the shared regression witness to require the machine code while preserving the usage status, exact message and no-write assertions. The full local run was started at two workers. The committed quick-tier timing file alone totals 7505 measured file-seconds, over 62 minutes at two workers before full-depth cases. Scoped execution covers all intended callers."
  "2026-11-24T15:48:28.586Z",codex-agent,"Build, typecheck, test compilation, lint, identity audit (5 approved identities), tracker health, duplication and docstrings passed. Seven focused files produced 182/183 on the first run. The only failure was the concurrent-loop case waiting 3014 ms for the live registration lock; the isolated retry passed 1/1 at the same timeout, with no source or threshold change. The full-suite attempt was stopped after 58 passing top-level rows under the test-time budget. Linked changelog test passed 1/1 in a tracker-free snapshot. Reverting just the guard fixture reproduces TS2739; the old shared refusal assertion fails on the typed code; each changelog entry point fails the regression test when its flag or forwarding is removed. PR CI runs quick Node 22/26 shards, configured coverage, release checks and Bun smoke. CI Deep owns the full npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-24T16:00:11.511Z",codex-agent,"CI run 45429830071, coverage shard 2, first failure: evolution transfer corrections survive SDK and both CLI commands and output modes. The older harness passed run-only flags through proposer validate. The current host refuses undeclared flags before dispatch. Match the native CLI flag sets for validate and run, retain every exact proposer_invalid correction and unchanged tracker check, and assert unknown_option separately for dataset and approval with an unopened file. The prior CI result is the revert witness. Local build, typecheck, test compilation, lint and all six non-packed cases in the affected file passed. The linked host refusal test passed 1/1. Packed coverage belongs to CI."
